    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Box&nbsp;4.01</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> Clinical criteria for recommending <em>TP53</em> germline testing</span></p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "WHO Classification of Tumours Editorial Board. Central nervous system tumours. Lyon (France): International Agency for Research on Cancer; 2021. (WHO classification of tumours series, 5th ed.; vol. 6). https://publications.iarc.who.int/601.",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 585.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"781\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 585.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"781\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Classic Li&ndash;Fraumeni syndrome (LFS) criteria </strong><span class=\"Ref-ID\"><span style=\"border: none;\"><span style=\"border: none;\">{3409256; 29039119}</span></span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 81.55pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 585.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 81.55pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"781\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">A proband with:</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>A sarcoma diagnosed before the age of 45&nbsp;years <strong>AND</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>A first-degree relative with any cancer before the age of 45&nbsp;years <strong>AND</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>A first- or second-degree relative with any cancer before the age of 45&nbsp;years or a sarcoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 585.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"781\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Revised Chompret criteria </strong><span class=\"Ref-ID\"><span style=\"border: none;\"><span style=\"border: none;\">{11332399; 18511570; 19652052; 34709361}</span></span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 585.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"781\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">A proband with:</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">1.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 564.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">A tumour belonging to the LFS tumour spectrum (soft tissue sarcoma, osteosarcoma, premenopausal breast cancer, brain tumour, adrenocortical carcinoma, leukaemia, or bronchoalveolar lung cancer) before the age of 46&nbsp;years <strong>AND </strong>at least one first- or second-degree relative with an LFS tumour (except breast cancer if the proband has breast cancer) before the age of 56&nbsp;years or with multiple tumours</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 585.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"781\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>OR</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">2.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 564.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Multiple tumours (except multiple breast tumours), two of which belong to the LFS tumour spectrum and the first of which occurred before the age of 46&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 585.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"781\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>OR</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">3.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 564.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Adrenocortical carcinoma or choroid plexus tumour, or anaplastic rhabdomyosarcoma of embryonal subtype, or osteosarcoma, or childhood hypodiploid acute lymphoblastic leukaemia, or sonic hedgehog medulloblastoma irrespective of family history</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 585.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"781\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>OR</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">4.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 564.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Breast cancer before the age of 31&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  },
  {
    "pkattachmentId": 80997,
    "bookid": 67,
    "chapterId": 93,
    "fileId": 37310,
    "type": "Table",
    "diagnosis": "",
    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Table&nbsp;4.01</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> Essential diagnostic criteria for Li&ndash;Fraumeni spectrum </span><span class=\"Ref-ID\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{34709361}</span></span></p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Christian P. Kratz",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 609.25pt; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" width=\"812\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 138.15pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"184\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Diagnosis</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 471.1pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"628\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Essential diagnostic criteria</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 138.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"184\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Phenotypic LFS</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 471.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"628\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">No P/LP germline (or mosaic) <em>TP53</em> variant <strong>AND</strong> no other genetic explanation <strong>AND</strong> meeting classic LFS criteria or at least one of the first two Chompret criteria</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 138.15pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"184\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">LFS</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 471.1pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"628\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">P/LP germline (or mosaic) <em>TP53</em> variant <strong>AND</strong> meeting LFS testing criteria <strong>AND/OR</strong> any cancer before age 18&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 138.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"184\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">LFS carrier</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 471.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"628\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">P/LP germline <em>TP53</em> variant <strong>AND</strong> no (history of) cancer <strong>AND</strong> LFS in family</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 138.15pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"184\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Attenuated LFS</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 471.1pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"628\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">P/LP germline (or mosaic) <em>TP53</em> variant <strong>AND</strong> (history of) cancer but not meeting LFS testing criteria <strong>AND</strong> no cancer before age 18&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 138.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"184\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Attenuated LFS carrier</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 471.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"628\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">P/LP germline <em>TP53</em> variant <strong>AND</strong> no (history of) cancer <strong>AND</strong> attenuated LFS in family</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 138.15pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"184\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Incidental LFS</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 471.1pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"628\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">P/LP germline (or mosaic) <em>TP53</em> variant <strong>AND</strong> no (history of) cancer <strong>AND</strong> no LFS or attenuated LFS in family</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">LFS, Li&ndash;Fraumeni syndrome; P/LP, pathogenic&nbsp;/ likely pathogenic.</span></p>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  },
